<title>ITALY: RUGBY UNION-ITALY A TO TOUR ZIMBABWE IN JUNE.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-ITALY A TO TOUR ZIMBABWE IN JUNE.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>An Italy A rugby union side will tour Zimbabwe in June and July, playing two tests in Harare and Bulawayo, the federation said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The first test will be on June 21 in Harare and the second on June 28 in Bulawayo. The other tour matches are against Goshawks, Harare Province and Matabeleland.</p>
</text>
